<Worksheet ss:Name="测算报告">
<Table>
<Column ss:Index="1" ss:Width="220"/>
<Column ss:Index="2" ss:Width="110"/>
<Column ss:Index="3" ss:Width="110"/>
<Column ss:Index="4" ss:Width="160"/>
<Row ss:Height="46"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sTitle" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">河北云游戏项目测算分析报告</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="10"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="Default"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="28"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxH2" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">根据业务提供的测算假设如下：</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">1. 项目周期：2026年8月 至 2027年7月（共 12 个月）（2026-08 起）</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">2. 收入「游戏收入」 按 单价 24 元 × 数量 2,645 × 周期 12 个月 测算 = 761,760 元 税率 6%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">3. 收入「手柄」 按 单价 99 元 × 数量 1,000 测算 = 99,000 元 税率 13%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">4. 商务成本「微信手续费」 按 收入合计 × 1% 计提 = 8,607.6 元 税率 6%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">5. 商务成本「当贝分成」 按 收入合计 × 10% 计提 = 86,076 元 税率 6%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">6. 技术成本「CDN成本」 固定金额 18,000 元 税率 6%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">7. 技术成本「155M专线」 按 单价 20,000 元 × 数量 1 × 周期 12 个月 测算 = 240,000 元 税率 9%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">8. 版权成本「央视版权诉讼」 按 单价 1.5 元 × 数量 2,645 × 周期 12 个月 测算 = 47,610 元 税率 6%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">9. 版权成本「频道引入」 按公式 (游戏收入-央视版权诉讼)*30% 计提 = 214,245 元 税率 6%</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyLast" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">10. 涉及税率档位：6% / 9% / 13%，不含税口径按各小项税率逐项换算</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="10"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="Default"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="28"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxH2" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">主要结论及提示：</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">1. 利润空间正常：成本占比 71.1%（不含税口径），项目利润空间处于健康区间。</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">2. 核心指标：收入 80.62 万元，成本 57.35 万元，毛利 23.27 万元，毛利率 28.9%，ROI 40.6%（不含税口径）。</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyRow" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">3. 成本结构中占比最高的是 版权成本（43.1%），建议作为成本管控重点。</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sBoxBodyLast" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">4. 提示：项目盈利性良好，可推进落地；建议持续跟踪实际收入与成本，按月复盘偏差。</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="10"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="Default"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="28"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sProfitH" ss:MergeAcross="2"><Data ss:Type="String">利润情况</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sTabH-thin" ss:MergeDown="1"><Data ss:Type="String">明细项目（不含税）</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabH-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">2026年8月-2027年7月</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sTabH-thin" ss:MergeDown="1"><Data ss:Type="String">备注</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabH-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">年（万元）</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sTabItem-lv0"><Data ss:Type="String">收入</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sLv0-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">80.62</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">游戏收入</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">71.86</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">手柄</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">8.76</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sTabItem-lv0"><Data ss:Type="String">成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sLv0-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">57.35</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sCat-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">商务成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sCatRow-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">8.93</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">微信手续费</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">0.81</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">当贝分成</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">8.12</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sCat-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">技术成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sCatRow-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">23.72</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">CDN成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">1.7</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">155M专线</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">22.02</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sCat-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">版权成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sCatRow-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">24.7</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">央视版权诉讼</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">4.49</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sSub-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">频道引入</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTabCell-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">20.21</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sCat-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">营销成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sCatRow-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">—</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">项目不涉及该成本</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sCat-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">人力成本</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sCatRow-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">—</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String">项目不涉及该成本</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sTabItem-total"><Data ss:Type="String">毛利</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sTotal-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">23.27</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row ss:Height="24"><Cell ss:Index="1" ss:StyleID="sTabItem-total"><Data ss:Type="String">毛利率</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="2" ss:StyleID="sPercent-thin"><Data ss:Type="Number">0.289</Data></Cell><Cell ss:Index="3" ss:StyleID="sRmk-thin"><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
</Table>
